          "title": "World of Warcraft Trading Card Game",
          "subtitle": "Vying",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "World of Warcraft Trading Card Game is an out-of-print proprietary TCG based on Blizzard Entertainments MMORPG."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "World of Warcraft Trading Card Game is documented as a distinct commercial card-game publication with its own player count, equipment, and objective."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Setup",
          "subtitle": "Table, deck, equipment, and deal",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "2 or more players use the table arrangement described for World of Warcraft Trading Card Game."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Constructed World of Warcraft TCG decks"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Constructed World of Warcraft TCG decks, score area, and enough table space for play."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Prepare Constructed World of Warcraft TCG decks and deal or lay out cards according to the documented World of Warcraft Trading Card Game rules before play begins."
